cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference this project, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Eclipse: a payment firewall for AI agents on NEAR"
abstract: >-
  Eclipse is a payment firewall for AI agents. The agent holds only a
  function-call key to a Guardian contract on NEAR; the contract holds the
  funds. Every payment request pauses while a checker (in OutLayer's TEE on
  testnet) fuses policy and provenance rules, a lookalike check, an injection
  classifier and a TypeSafe Jev decision into allow, hold or block. The
  contract pays only on an exact receiver, token, amount and request_id match,
  inside hard caps, and writes an on-chain receipt for every outcome.
authors:
  - name: "Eclipse team (NEAR HACKATHON 2026)"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Jimuelle07/backlogs-near"
url: "https://eclipse-9le.pages.dev/"
license: MIT
keywords:
